# Blog CMS (Supabase) — see docs/BLOG_ADMIN_CHATGPT_WORK_AUTOMATION.md
#
# Both of these are safe to expose to the browser (anon key is
# RLS-restricted to published content + whatever an authenticated admin
# is explicitly allowed to see/do). No service-role/secret key is used
# anywhere in this app — all writes go through the signed-in admin's own
# RLS-checked session, never a privileged bypass key.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
